{"title":"最小 Tap Game","summary":"一个单文件极简点击游戏：30 秒内不断点击圆形目标得分，支持开始、重开与最高分记录。","html":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>最小 Tap Game</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card: #111827;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #22c55e;
      --accent-2: #38bdf8;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b, var(--bg));
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .game {
      width: min(92vw, 420px);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.92);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .stats {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .value {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .arena {
      position: relative;
      height: 320px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(56,189,248,.12), rgba(34,197,94,.08));
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    }
    .target {
      position: absolute;
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #fff, #86efac 35%, var(--accent) 70%);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(34,197,94,.35);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform .08s ease;
    }
    .target:active { transform: scale(.94); }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    button.ctrl {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: white;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-2), var(--accent));
    }
    .hint {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(2, 6, 23, .45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="game">
    <div class="stats">
      <div>分数<span id="score" class="value">0</span></div>
      <div>时间<span id="time" class="value">30</span></div>
      <div>最高分<span id="best" class="value">0</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="arena" id="arena">
      <button class="target" id="target" aria-label="tap target"></button>
      <div class="overlay" id="overlay">点击开始，然后尽可能多地点中绿色圆点</div>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
      <button class="ctrl" id="start">开始游戏</button>
      <button class="ctrl" id="reset">重开</button>
    </div>
    <div class="hint">30 秒内每点击一次得 1 分</div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const arena = document.getElementById('arena');
    const target = document.getElementById('target');
    const scoreEl = document.getElementById('score');
    const timeEl = document.getElementById('time');
    const bestEl = document.getElementById('best');
    const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');
    const startBtn = document.getElementById('start');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');

    let score = 0;
    let time = 30;
    let timer = null;
    let playing = false;
    let best = Number(localStorage.getItem('minimal-tap-best') || 0);
    bestEl.textContent = best;

    function moveTarget() {
      const padding = 12;
      const maxX = arena.clientWidth - target.offsetWidth - padding;
      const maxY = arena.clientHeight - target.offsetHeight - padding;
      const x = Math.max(padding, Math.random() * maxX);
      const y = Math.max(padding, Math.random() * maxY);
      target.style.left = x + 'px';
      target.style.top = y + 'px';
    }

    function render() {
      scoreEl.textContent = score;
      timeEl.textContent = time;
      bestEl.textContent = best;
    }

    function endGame() {
      playing = false;
      clearInterval(timer);
      timer = null;
      if (score > best) {
        best = score;
        localStorage.setItem('minimal-tap-best', String(best));
      }
      render();
      overlay.hidden = false;
      overlay.textContent = '时间到，得分 ' + score + '。点击开始再来一局';
    }

    function startGame() {
      score = 0;
      time = 30;
      playing = true;
      render();
      overlay.hidden = true;
      moveTarget();
      clearInterval(timer);
      timer = setInterval(() => {
        time -= 1;
        render();
        if (time <= 0) endGame();
      }, 1000);
    }

    target.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!playing) return;
      score += 1;
      render();
      moveTarget();
    });

    startBtn.addEventListener('click', startGame);
    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', startGame);
    window.addEventListener('resize', moveTarget);

    render();
    moveTarget();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}

